n-only, open-source classifier (Llama-Guard / HarmBench classifier), or external LLM judge?\", \"What compute budget and attack-step cap is acceptable, and must it match prior SSP-defence papers' published step counts?\", \"What is the token-level adversary surface \\u2014 user message only, or system prompt also editable?\", \"Is benign-helpfulness / over-refusal a co-equal primary outcome with its own N and significance rule, or strictly a sanity check?\", \"Are multi-turn / escalation prompt-level attacks in-scope, changing the unit of analysis to conversation-level?\"]}", "origin": "completion"}, "llm_response_id": "chatcmpl-76cdc9ac-0ec6-4112-b1bf-32d2cae3b0ce", "security_risk": "UNKNOWN", "kind": "ActionEvent", "source_event_index": 18}
